          "description": "A dark fang can cause a hole to engulf a single target within 30 ft. The target must make a Reflex save (DC 24) or be inflicted with Immobilize status for 1d4 rounds. Blue mages may learn this ability as a 2nd level spell (Knowledge: Arcana DC 19).",
